        "languages": [],
        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>A <strong>merchant</strong> wants to come out of any conversation with a favorable deal. They use their Business Acumen feature to maintain the upper hand under pressure, then whittle the characters’ focus down with their Counterargument action. However, merchants aren’t keen on making enemies—so if things aren’t going the merchant’s way, they prefer to compromise rather than lose a contact. </p><p>Merchants are rarely well-equipped for combat. In the event of a fight, they immediately attempt to flee, using attacks to cover their escape.</p>",
        "role": "rival"
    },
